{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39821","headline":"寄广南刘仆射 · 殷文圭","name":"寄广南刘仆射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"战国从今却尚文，品流才子作将军。\n画船清宴蛮溪雨，粉阁闲吟瘴峤云。\n暴客卸戈归惠政，史官调笔待儒勳。\n汉仪一化南人後，牧马无因更夜闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}